Canva Template — Authoring notes & editable structure

File overview:
- Pages: 7 (Cover + Bride + Groom + Maid of Honor + Best Man + Parents + Vendors)
- Page size: US Letter (8.5x11) default; include A4 variant page at end
- Named layers/groups per page: [Header], [Section_24hrs], [Section_Morning], [Section_Ceremony], [Section_Vendor], [Contacts], [Footer]

Fonts (editable):
- Heading: Playfair Display (or substitute 'Libre Baskerville')
- Body: Lato Regular

Color swatches (2 default):
- Light: #FFFFFF (bg), #2C2C2C (text), #D8B4A6 (accent)
- Dark: #FAF8F6 (bg), #1A1A1A (text), #A1C6D9 (accent)

Components to build and keep editable:
- Checkbox element (grouped, name=checkbox)
- Contact block (text fields for name & phone)
- Time field (editable text)
- Section title blocks (editable)
- Optional logo/branding placeholder

Export guidance included in template notes: export PDF print-ready (bleed 0.125in) and PNG social sizes. Provide a separate page with font/source credits and Canva share instructions.